Statement of Purpose

The laws of most jurisdictions throughout the world automatically confer
exclusive Copyright and Related Rights (defined below) upon the creator
and subsequent owner(s) (each and all, an "owner") of an original work of
authorship and/or a database (each, a "Work").

A mere collection of individual words in a language, compiled for the
purpose of listing which words exist, is a factual/informational
compilation rather than a creative expression, and to the maximum extent
permitted by applicable law the contributors to this repository disclaim
and waive any and all copyright and related or neighboring rights in the
word data, and dedicate it to the public domain via CC0 1.0 Universal, so
that anyone - including AI models, researchers, game developers and
dictionary apps - may use it freely, without restriction, without
attribution, and without asking permission.
